<section id=3D"submitting-a-batch-job">
<span id=3D"submit-job"></span><h3>Submitting A Batch Job<a class=3D"header=
link" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide=
/slurm/slurm.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#submitting-a-batch-job" title=3D=
"Link to this heading">#</a></h3>
<p>After you have written and saved your submission script, you can submit =
your job. At the command line type</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell2" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>s=
batch<span class=3D"w"> </span>&lt;name_of_script&gt;
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell2">
