</div>
<p>where, in the example above <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"=
><span class=3D"pre">&lt;name_of_script&gt;</span></code> would be <code cl=
ass=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">jobscript.sh</span=
></code>.  If your submission script is not in your current working directo=
ry, either change to that directory or specify the path to the submission s=
cript as part of the command.</p>
<p>Upon submission the scheduler will return your job number:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-default notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell3" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"n">Submitted</=
span> <span class=3D"n">batch</span> <span class=3D"n">job</span> <span cla=
ss=3D"mi">549005</span>
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell3">
