</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p>If you have a workflow that accepts or needs the <code class=3D"docutils=
 literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">jobid</span></code> as an input f=
or job monitoring or job dependencies, then you may prefer the return value=
 of your job submission be just the job number. To do this, pass the <code =
class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">--parsable</span=
></code> argument:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell4" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>s=
batch<span class=3D"w"> </span>--parsable<span class=3D"w"> </span>&lt;name=
_of_script&gt;
<span class=3D"go">549005</span>
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell4">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
