</div>
</section>
<section id=3D"priority-access-partitions">
<h3>Priority Access Partitions<a class=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsd=
ocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/slurm/slurm.html?utm_sourc=
e=3Dchatgpt.com#priority-access-partitions" title=3D"Link to this heading">=
#</a></h3>
<p>Priority Access partitions are available to users who are part of a Proj=
ect containing <a class=3D"reference external" href=3D"https://www.it.north=
western.edu/secure/purchasing-resources.html" target=3D"_blank">purchased c=
ompute resources <svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.0em" height=3D"1.0em" view=
Box=3D"0 0 16 16" aria-hidden=3D"true" style=3D"display: inline-block; vert=
ical-align: middle; fill: currentColor;"><path d=3D"M3.75 2h3.5a.75.75 0 0 =
