path></svg></a>. The capacity available and any limits on jobs are governed=
 by the specific policies of the Slurm account associated with the Priority=
 Access compute resources.</p>
<p>In addition to setting the <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate">=
<span class=3D"pre">-A</span></code>/<code class=3D"docutils literal notran=
slate"><span class=3D"pre">--account</span></code> value to the Slurm accou=
nt name, set the partition to either the Slurm account name or =E2=80=9Cbuy=
in=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p>Example:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-bash notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre id=
