</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Choose the <a class=3D"reference internal" href=
=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/slurm/slu=
rm.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#partitions">partition</a> based on the res=
ources and time required for the job.</p>
</div>
</details><details class=3D"sd-sphinx-override sd-dropdown sd-card sd-mb-3"=
 id=3D"opt-time">
<summary class=3D"sd-summary-title sd-card-header">
