<section id=3D"slurm-commands-and-job-management">
<span id=3D"managing-jobs"></span><h2>Slurm Commands and Job Management<a c=
lass=3D"headerlink" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/qu=
est/user-guide/slurm/slurm.html?utm_source=3Dchatgpt.com#slurm-commands-and=
-job-management" title=3D"Link to this heading">#</a></h2>
<p>Once a job has been submitted, additional Slurm commands are available t=
o monitor and manage the job.</p>
<p><strong>Common Slurm Commands</strong></p>
<div class=3D"pst-scrollable-table-container" tabindex=3D"-1"><table class=
=3D"table">
<thead>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><th class=3D"head"><p>Action</p></th>
<th class=3D"head"><p>Slurm Command</p></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p>Delete a job</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sca=
ncel</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</span> <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</=
span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><td><p>Job status (by job)</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">squ=
eue</span> <span class=3D"pre">-j</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</span>=
 <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p>Job status (by user)</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">squ=
eue</span> <span class=3D"pre">-u</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;netid&gt;<=
/span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><td><p>Job status (detailed)</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sco=
ntrol</span> <span class=3D"pre">show</span> <span class=3D"pre">job</span>=
 <span class=3D"pre">-dd</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span></code> <br> <code class=3D"docutils literal notra=
nslate"><span class=3D"pre">checkjob</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</sp=
an> <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p>Show expected start time</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">squ=
eue</span> <span class=3D"pre">-j</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</span>=
 <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span> <span class=3D"pre">--start</span></code=
></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><td><p>Queue list / info</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sco=
ntrol</span> <span class=3D"pre">show</span> <span class=3D"pre">partition<=
/span> <span class=3D"pre">[queue]</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p>Hold a job</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sco=
ntrol</span> <span class=3D"pre">hold</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job</s=
pan> <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><td><p>Release a job</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sco=
ntrol</span> <span class=3D"pre">release</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job=
</span> <span class=3D"pre">ID&gt;</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p>Monitor or review a job=E2=80=99s resource us=
age</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sac=
ct</span> <span class=3D"pre">-j</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job_num&gt;=
</span> <span class=3D"pre">--format=3DJobID,jobname,NTasks,nodelist,CPUTim=
e,ReqMem,Elapsed</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><td><p>View job batch script</p></td>
<td><p><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sac=
ct</span> <span class=3D"pre">-j</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;job_num&gt;=
</span> <span class=3D"pre">-B</span></code></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Further details and options for these commands are in the sections below=
.</p>
