ormation about current jobs on Quest.  <code class=3D"docutils literal notr=
anslate"><span class=3D"pre">squeue</span></code> alone will show all jobs =
across all users.  Use the <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><sp=
an class=3D"pre">-u</span></code> option to limit the output to your NetID.=
</p>
<div class=3D"pst-scrollable-table-container" tabindex=3D"-1"><table class=
=3D"table">
<thead>
<tr class=3D"row-odd"><th class=3D"head"><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Command<=
/p></th>
