 literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">squeue</span> <span class=3D"pre"=
>-A</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;account-name&gt;</span></code></p></td>
<td><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Show only jobs belonging to Slurm account spe=
cified</p></td>
</tr>
<tr class=3D"row-even"><td><p class=3D"sd-card-text"><code class=3D"docutil=
