 id=3D"sacct">
<summary class=3D"sd-summary-title sd-card-header">
<span class=3D"sd-summary-icon"><svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.0em" height=
=3D"1.0em" class=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon-note" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" aria-=
hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M0 3.75C0 2.784.784 2 1.75 2h12.5c.966 0 1.75.78=
4 1.75 1.75v8.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.25 14H1.75A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 12.25Zm1.75=
-.25a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v8.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h12.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v=
-8.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25ZM3.5 6.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h7a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1=
.5h-7a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Zm.75 2.25h4a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4a.75.75 0 0 1 0=
-1.5Z"></path></svg></span><span class=3D"sd-summary-text">List Current and=
 Past Jobs with sacct</span><span class=3D"sd-summary-state-marker sd-summa=
ry-chevron-right"><svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.5em" height=3D"1.5em" cla=
ss=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon-chevron-right" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidde=
n=3D"true"><path d=3D"M8.72 18.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06L14.44 12 8.72 6.28a.7=
51.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018l6.25 6.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1=
.06l-6.25 6.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0Z"></path></svg></span></summary><div cla=
ss=3D"sd-summary-content sd-card-body docutils">
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">The <a class=3D"reference external" href=3D"https=
://slurm.schedmd.com/sacct.html" target=3D"_blank"><code class=3D"docutils =
literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sacct</span></code> command <svg v=
ersion=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.0em" height=3D"1.0em" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" aria-=
hidden=3D"true" style=3D"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; fil=
l: currentColor;"><path d=3D"M3.75 2h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5a.25.25 0 0=
 0-.25.25v8.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h8.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-3.5a.75.75 0 0 =
1 1.5 0v3.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 12.25 14h-8.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 2 12.25v-8.5C2 2.=
784 2.784 2 3.75 2Zm6.854-1h4.146a.25.25 0 0 1 .25.25v4.146a.25.25 0 0 1-.4=
27.177L13.03 4.03 9.28 7.78a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.=
042l3.75-3.75-1.543-1.543A.25.25 0 0 1 10.604 1Z"></path></svg></a> can be =
used display information about your past and
current jobs on Quest.  By default, <code class=3D"docutils literal notrans=
late"><span class=3D"pre">sacct</span></code> will only display information=
 about jobs
from today. Unlike the <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span c=
lass=3D"pre">squeue</span></code> command, there is no need to supply <code=
 class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">-u</span> <span=
 class=3D"pre">&lt;netid&gt;</span></code> to <code class=3D"docutils liter=
al notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sacct</span></code> as it will do this =
by default. The default output includes just a few fields: job ID, jobname,
partition, account, allocated CPUs (AllocCPUs), state, and exit code.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Example:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell25" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>=
sacct<span class=3D"w"> </span>-X<span class=3D"w"> </span>
<span class=3D"go">JobID      JobName Partition  Account AllocCPUS   State =
ExitCode</span>
<span class=3D"go">------------ ---------- ---------- ---------- ----------=
 ---------- --------</span>
<span class=3D"go">1453894      bash      short   p1234     1 COMPLETED   0=
:0</span>
<span class=3D"go">1454434   sample_job      short   p1234     52   FAILED =
  6:0 </span>
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell25">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
  <path stroke=3D"none" d=3D"M0 0h24v24H0z" fill=3D"none"></path>
  <rect x=3D"8" y=3D"8" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" rx=3D"2"></rect>
  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">We strongly recommend including the <code class=
=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">-X</span></code> flag=
 when using <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre=
">sacct</span></code>. This flag will suppress the output to only show stat=
istics relevant to the job itself and will exclude the individual job steps=
 which are not relevant for the vast majority of situations.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">The lone exception to this is when you would like=
 to display information related to the GPU utilization of the job. This inf=
ormation is contained in the =E2=80=9Cbatch=E2=80=9D step of the job, and c=
an be displayed for a given job via the following command:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell26" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>=
sacct<span class=3D"w"> </span>-j<span class=3D"w"> </span>&lt;slurm-jobid&=
gt;.batch<span class=3D"w"> </span>--format<span class=3D"o">=3D</span>jobi=
d,tresusagein%120
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell26">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
  <path stroke=3D"none" d=3D"M0 0h24v24H0z" fill=3D"none"></path>
  <rect x=3D"8" y=3D"8" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" rx=3D"2"></rect>
  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">For example,</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell27" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>=
sacct<span class=3D"w"> </span>-j<span class=3D"w"> </span><span class=3D"m=
">3547592</span>.batch<span class=3D"w"> </span>--format<span class=3D"o">=
=3D</span>jobid,tresusagein%120
<span class=3D"go">JobID                                                   =
                                                               TRESUsageInA=
ve </span>
<span class=3D"go">------------ -------------------------------------------=
---------------------------------------------------------------------------=
-- </span>
<span class=3D"go">3547592.bat+          cpu=3D00:04:56,energy=3D0,fs/disk=
=3D13439086206,gres/gpumem=3D6218M,gres/gpuutil=3D95,mem=3D5825476K,pages=
=3D0,vmem=3D21553268K </span>
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell27">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
  <path stroke=3D"none" d=3D"M0 0h24v24H0z" fill=3D"none"></path>
  <rect x=3D"8" y=3D"8" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" rx=3D"2"></rect>
  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">The state codes are available in the <a class=3D"=
reference external" href=3D"https://slurm.schedmd.com/sacct.html#SECTION_JO=
B-STATE-CODES" target=3D"_blank">Slurm documentation <svg version=3D"1.1" w=
idth=3D"1.0em" height=3D"1.0em" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" aria-hidden=3D"true" =
style=3D"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; fill: currentColor;=
"><path d=3D"M3.75 2h3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-3.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v8.5c0 =
.138.112.25.25.25h8.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-3.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0v3.5A1.75=
 1.75 0 0 1 12.25 14h-8.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 2 12.25v-8.5C2 2.784 2.784 2 3.75=
 2Zm6.854-1h4.146a.25.25 0 0 1 .25.25v4.146a.25.25 0 0 1-.427.177L13.03 4.0=
3 9.28 7.78a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042l3.75-3.75-1.=
543-1.543A.25.25 0 0 1 10.604 1Z"></path></svg></a>.  The exit codes do not=
 have standard meanings across all jobs, but they can be used in troublesho=
oting.  A normal exit code with no errors is <code class=3D"docutils litera=
l notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">0:0</span></code>.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">To include additional information in the output o=
f <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sacct</s=
pan></code>, add the <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span cla=
ss=3D"pre">--format</span></code> option with a comma separated list of val=
ues for the <a class=3D"reference external" href=3D"https://slurm.schedmd.c=
om/sacct.html#OPT_helpformat" target=3D"_blank">additional fields <svg vers=
