iling.html#jobstats-tool"><span class=3D"std std-ref">Jobstats</span></a> i=
s our recommended tool for monitoring your job=E2=80=99s compute resource u=
tilization. It generates detailed efficiency reports including statistics a=
bout usage of CPUs, CPU memory, GPUs, and GPU memory. Running <code class=
=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">jobstats</span></code=
> helps to highlight performance issues in your workflow and right-size com=
pute resource requests in submission scripts.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">To generate an efficiency report for your job, ru=
n the command:</p>
