  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Jobstats can be run on an in-progress or complete=
d job, but will not generate a report for jobs with runtime under 1-2 minut=
es. Learn more about <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span cla=
ss=3D"pre">jobstats</span></code> on our <a class=3D"reference internal" hr=
ef=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/systems/quest/user-guide/job-pro=
filing/job-profiling.html#job-profiling"><span class=3D"std std-ref">job pr=
ofiling tools page</span></a>.</p>
</div>
