  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">The job control command (<code class=3D"docutils =
literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">scontrol</span></code>) can also b=
e used for changing the parameters of a submitted job <strong>before</stron=
g> it starts running. The following parameters can be modified safely:</p>
<ul class=3D"simple">
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Job dependency (change to =E2=80=9Cnone=E2=80=
=9D)</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Partition</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Job name</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Wall clock limit</p></li>
<li><p class=3D"sd-card-text">Slurm Account</p></li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Examples of using <code class=3D"docutils literal=
 notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">scontrol</span></code> to change a job=E2=
=80=99s parameters:</p>
<div class=3D"pst-scrollable-table-container" tabindex=3D"-1"><table class=
=3D"table">
