.5h-7a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Zm.75 2.25h4a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4a.75.75 0 0 1 0=
-1.5Z"></path></svg></span><span class=3D"sd-summary-text">Job Arrays</span=
><span class=3D"sd-summary-state-marker sd-summary-chevron-right"><svg vers=
ion=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.5em" height=3D"1.5em" class=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon=
-chevron-right" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M8.72=
 18.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06L14.44 12 8.72 6.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751=
