<div class=3D"admonition tip">
<p class=3D"admonition-title">Tip</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Make sure that the number of lines in the input f=
ile matches the number of jobs specified by <code class=3D"docutils literal=
 notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">--array</span></code>.</p>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text"><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><spa=
n class=3D"pre">myscript.py</span></code> contains the following code to re=
ad a <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">--fil=
ename</span></code> argument from the command line:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-python notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre i=
d=3D"codecell46" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"kn">import</sp=
an><span class=3D"w"> </span><span class=3D"nn">argparse</span>
<span class=3D"kn">import</span><span class=3D"w"> </span><span class=3D"nn=
">time</span>

<span class=3D"k">def</span><span class=3D"w"> </span><span class=3D"nf">pa=
rse_commandline</span><span class=3D"p">():</span>
    <span class=3D"n">parser</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span clas=
s=3D"n">argparse</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">Argument=
Parser</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">description</span>=
<span class=3D"o">=3D</span><span class=3D"vm">__doc__</span><span class=3D=
"p">)</span>
    <span class=3D"n">parser</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D=
"n">add_argument</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"s2">"--file=
name"</span><span class=3D"p">,</span>
                        <span class=3D"n">help</span><span class=3D"o">=3D<=
/span><span class=3D"s2">"Name of file"</span><span class=3D"p">,</span>
                        <span class=3D"n">default</span><span class=3D"o">=
=3D</span><span class=3D"kc">None</span><span class=3D"p">)</span>
    <span class=3D"n">args</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=
=3D"n">parser</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">parse_args<=
/span><span class=3D"p">()</span>
    <span class=3D"k">return</span> <span class=3D"n">args</span>

<span class=3D"k">if</span> <span class=3D"vm">__name__</span> <span class=
=3D"o">=3D=3D</span> <span class=3D"s1">'__main__'</span><span class=3D"p">=
:</span>
    <span class=3D"n">args</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=
=3D"n">parse_commandline</span><span class=3D"p">()</span>
    <span class=3D"nb">print</span><span class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D=
"n">args</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">filename</span><=
span class=3D"p">)</span>
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell46">
