  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text"><code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><spa=
n class=3D"pre">myscript.py</span></code> will receive the value from <code=
 class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">input.csv</span=
></code> as an argument.  The first job in the array will receive =E2=80=9C=
filename1.txt=E2=80=9D as the input, the second job will receive =E2=80=9Cf=
ilename2.txt=E2=80=9D as the input, etc.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Submit the script as normal with <code class=3D"d=
ocutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sbatch</span></code>:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell47" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>=
sbatch<span class=3D"w"> </span>jobsubmission.sh
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell47">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
  <path stroke=3D"none" d=3D"M0 0h24v24H0z" fill=3D"none"></path>
  <rect x=3D"8" y=3D"8" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" rx=3D"2"></rect>
  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">The job array will then be submitted to the sched=
uler with each array element requesting the same resources (such as number =
of cores, time, memory etc.) per job.</p>
