ssion script specified. CPU count is the number of cores requested by your =
job submission script. Cores are also called processors or CPUs.</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">To fix this error, use the <code class=3D"docutil=
s literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">sinfo</span></code> command to g=
