<p class=3D"sd-card-text"><strong>Fix:</strong> From the command line on Qu=
est run the command <code class=3D"docutils literal notranslate"><span clas=
s=3D"pre">dos2unix</span> <span class=3D"pre">&lt;submission_script&gt;</sp=
