<p class=3D"sd-card-text"><strong>Possible issue</strong>: The job submissi=
on script is not purging modules before starting the job on the compute nod=
e</p>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text"><strong>Fix</strong>: After the <code class=3D"do=
cutils literal notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">#SBATCH</span></code> direc=
tives in your job submission script, add the line</p>
<div class=3D"highlight-console notranslate"><div class=3D"highlight"><pre =
id=3D"codecell61" tabindex=3D"-1"><span></span><span class=3D"gp">$ </span>=
module<span class=3D"w"> </span>purge<span class=3D"w"> </span>all
</pre><button class=3D"copybtn o-tooltip--left" data-tooltip=3D"Copy" data-=
clipboard-target=3D"#codecell61">
      <svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class=3D"icon icon-tabler i=
con-tabler-copy" width=3D"44" height=3D"44" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" stroke-wi=
dth=3D"1.5" stroke=3D"#000000" fill=3D"none" stroke-linecap=3D"round" strok=
e-linejoin=3D"round">
  <title>Copy to clipboard</title>
  <path stroke=3D"none" d=3D"M0 0h24v24H0z" fill=3D"none"></path>
  <rect x=3D"8" y=3D"8" width=3D"12" height=3D"12" rx=3D"2"></rect>
  <path d=3D"M16 8v-2a2 2 0 0 0 -2 -2h-8a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2">=
</path>
</svg>
    </button></div>
</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">This will clear any modules inherited from your l=
ogin session and begin your job in a clean environment. You will need to lo=
ad any necessary modules into your job submission script after this line.</=
p>
</div>
</details><details class=3D"sd-sphinx-override sd-dropdown sd-card sd-mb-3"=
>
<summary class=3D"sd-summary-title sd-card-header">
<span class=3D"sd-summary-icon"><svg version=3D"1.1" width=3D"1.0em" height=
=3D"1.0em" class=3D"sd-octicon sd-octicon-bug" viewBox=3D"0 0 16 16" aria-h=
