on-chevron-right" viewBox=3D"0 0 24 24" aria-hidden=3D"true"><path d=3D"M8.=
72 18.78a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06L14.44 12 8.72 6.28a.751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.7=
