</div>
<p class=3D"sd-card-text">Check the reported job =E2=80=9CState=E2=80=9D an=
d =E2=80=9CCPU memory usage=E2=80=9D. In this case, the job utilized a maxi=
mum of 60GB of CPU memory throughout its runtime. Therefore, next time you =
run the job, request 65-70GB of memory with <code class=3D"docutils literal=
 notranslate"><span class=3D"pre">--mem=3D65G</span></code>. See our <a cla=
ss=3D"reference internal" href=3D"https://rcdsdocs.it.northwestern.edu/syst=
ems/quest/user-guide/job-profiling/job-profiling.html#job-profiling"><span =
class=3D"std std-ref">job profiling tools page</span></a> for more informat=
ion about jobstats.</p>
